        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Thanks, you are right, it's simpler:\n\n```lua\nlocal exitmsg_ns = vim.api.nvim_create_namespace(\"nvim.terminal.exitmsg\")\n\nvim.api.nvim_create_autocmd(\"TermClose\", {\n  callback = function(args)\n    if not vim.api.nvim_buf_is_valid(args.buf) then\n      return\n    end\n    vim.api.nvim_buf_clear_namespace(args.buf, exitmsg_ns, 0, -1)\n    vim.api.nvim_buf_set_extmark(args.buf, exitmsg_ns, args.data.pos, 0, {\n      virt_text = { { (\"[Process exited %d]\"):format(vim.v.event.status), \"NonText\" } },\n      virt_text_pos = \"overlay\",\n    })\n  end,\n})\n```",
            "created_at": "2026-10-31T18:31:56Z",
